<title>BELGIUM: EGECIM H1 1996 PROFIT DOWN.</title>
<headline>EGECIM H1 1996 PROFIT DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   0.3 vs 0.7</p>
<p>    Earnings/share (in francs)     0.4 vs 0.8</p>
<p>    Current profit		     0.5 vs 1.1</p>
<p>    Estimated taxation		 0.2 vs 0.4</p>
<p>    Financial income		   0.9 vs 1.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Egecim SA, a Belgian shell company in liquidation, said it expected second-half profit to be in line with that of the first half.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
